msgid "与卡片 UI 的“合金与组分”分组一致。这些卡片负责合金原型、目标配比、离散占位、 条件替换。先区分“定义配比空间”与“把配比真正落到原子位点”。"
msgstr ""
"This section matches the `Alloys and Composition` group in the card picker. These "
"cards cover alloy prototypes, target compositions, discrete site occupancy, and "
"conditional replacement. First distinguish between defining a composition space and "
"actually assigning that composition to atomic sites."
